lse,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a00e7267efaf7157ee396c69270e0c73d2e7d8da1b6a463d6215031f44448d93.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/107314033610469-1774601223005.webp","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/107314033610469-1774601223005.webp"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a00e7267efaf7157ee396c69270e0c73d2e7d8da1b6a463d6215031f44448d93.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/107314033610469-1774601223005.webp","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/107314033610469-1774601223005.webp"},"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2026-03-27T08:47:03.032Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-27T08:47:03.032Z","lastBump":"2026-03-27T08:47:03.032Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/repzzwtw/.o/refs/heads/main/FRFBR.lua\"))()","features":"# Version 1. 3. 1.3.3\n\nhttps://discord.gg/2j5F3JGubc\nFor more scripts\n\nWhat's new?\n\n- Rebuilt and used a UI created by Lxte for smoother.\n- Fixed issues with the auto-spin wheels not spinning.\n\n - Added a Search Function so that you can search the functions inside of the UI \n\n- Added an advanced fly logic (PC only)\n\n- Added a custom RGB for the ESP and hitbox\n\n- Added a theme Switcher that can be located in the Settings/misc  tab\n\nAnd that's pretty much it.\n\n- - - - - - - - -\n\nᴍᴀᴅᴇ ʙʏ REPZZ\n\nNOTE: This script is still in early development and was recently created, so please expect bugs, glitches, or issues that may not work perfectly yet.\n\nFeatures:\n\n[💎] OP Main Farm: Auto-buy all brainrots (including Secret/Galaxy/Golden), auto- flip all rocks (with custom support for Small Mythic/Secret stones), and auto-upgrade all floors.\n​[⚔]Combat & Visuals: Full Player ESP with a custom color picker and a hitbox expander with RGB customization to help you win every fight.\n​[🎒] Gear: Auto- purchase and auto- equip all gear.\n​[⚡] Local Player: Speed and jump sliders with a built- in speed bypass to prevent the game from resetting your walk speed.\n​[🛠] Utility: Anti- AFK (never get kicked), FPS booster, server hopper, and a live server uptime tracker.\n[​📁] Integrated hubs: Quick access to Infinite Yield, CMD- X, and Nameless Admin.\n\n_______________\n\n​How to use:\n​Copy the script.\n​Execute it using your preferred executor.\n​Enjoy being the richest/strongest in the server!\n\n_______________\n\nWhat this script does:\n\n_______________\n\nThis script is mainly designed to make grinding easier and faster.\nInstead of doing everything manually, it automates most basic tasks, so you can relax while it runs.\nIt also includes movement features like fly, speed, and noclip to make getting around much easier.\n\n______________________________\n\n**NOTES**\n______________________________\n\nSome features might be buggy (especially auto- buying specific brainrots)\n\n.\n\nPerformance may depend on your device.\nAnti- lag features help, but are not perfect.\n\n\n\nMore features and fixes will be added over time.\n\n______________________________\n\nWhy did I make this?\n\n______________________________\n\nWhile scrolling through Scriptblox's Discord server, I wanted to create something useful and simple that genuinely helps with grinding without being complicated. Then I came across a player looking for a \"Flip Rocks for Brainrot\" script but couldn't find one. So I decided to jump back onto Scriptblox and drop a server-side custom script just for that guy and the whole universe!\n\n______________________________\n\n**DISCLAIMER**\n\n\n\nUse at your own risk. This script is intended for personal use and entertainment purposes only.","tags":["Overpowered","Script","Roblox","Flip Rocks for brainrots","Early development"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/2j5F3JGubc","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"698590eb10146ba1ee4a768b","username":"repzz","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/682bf36072e3ba9e2b81461e00fbcb5fb7edbf5d5f4a9acd5cf97bbba1b41ba0.webp","original":"https: